<tu tuid="b13230000000000000000000001-0"><prop type="id">b13230000000000000000000001</prop><prop type="project">Blender</prop><prop type="component">blender-ui-sv-reviewed-batch-1323-fbx-space-transform.po</prop><prop type="context"></prop><prop type="unit">FBX bake_space_transform</prop><prop type="publication_status">local-reviewed-delta</prop><prop type="source_plural"></prop><prop type="evidence">https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/9280a71e/Blender/blender-ui-sv-reviewed-batch-1323-fbx-space-transform.po</prop><prop type="evidence_sha256">142af35885ae8747a2aff04060d7ec8d13226da7a253448dcb93bdcece0bdb5b</prop><prop type="source_evidence">{}</prop><prop type="note_json">"FBX coordinate-transform context reviewed."</prop><prop type="plural_index">0</prop><tuv xml:lang="en"><seg>Bake space transform into object data, avoids getting unwanted rotations to objects when target space is not aligned with Blender's space (WARNING! experimental option, use at own risk, known to be broken with armatures/animations)</seg></tuv><tuv xml:lang="sv"><seg>Baka rymdtransformering till objektdata för att undvika oönskade objektrotationer när målrymden inte är inriktad med Blenders rymd (VARNING! Experimentellt alternativ; använd på egen risk, känt för att inte fungera med armaturer/animeringar)</seg></tuv></tu>
<tu tuid="b13230000000000000000000002-0"><prop type="id">b13230000000000000000000002</prop><prop type="project">Blender</prop><prop type="component">blender-ui-sv-reviewed-batch-1323-fbx-space-transform.po</prop><prop type="context"></prop><prop type="unit">FBX use_space_transform</prop><prop type="publication_status">local-reviewed-delta</prop><prop type="source_plural"></prop><prop type="evidence">https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/9280a71e/Blender/blender-ui-sv-reviewed-batch-1323-fbx-space-transform.po</prop><prop type="evidence_sha256">142af35885ae8747a2aff04060d7ec8d13226da7a253448dcb93bdcece0bdb5b</prop><prop type="source_evidence">{}</prop><prop type="note_json">"FBX coordinate-transform context reviewed."</prop><prop type="plural_index">0</prop><tuv xml:lang="en"><seg>Apply global space transform to the object rotations. When disabled only the axis space is written to the file and all object transforms are left as-is</seg></tuv><tuv xml:lang="sv"><seg>Tillämpa global rymdtransformering på objektrotationerna. När den är inaktiverad skrivs endast axelrymden till filen och alla objekttransformeringar lämnas oförändrade</seg></tuv></tu>
